1
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:42,740
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,570
[Episode 6: What It Cost Me to Leave Him]
、

3
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,580
This is the $100,000
Chunsheng gave you.

4
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,200
Ms. Chu,

5
00:01:40,789 --> 00:01:41,620
I've always respected

6
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:43,820
what you've accomplished in business.

7
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,930
But I never expected

8
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,800
you to resort to something so cliché,

9
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,720
and use someone else's name to do it.

10
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,720
Do you think

11
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,200
I'd take this as a breakup payment?

12
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,740
This isn't a breakup payment.

13
00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:57,000
This is a betrothal gift from Chunsheng.

14
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,600
The deal is that

15
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,970
you marry into the Chu family
and settle down as Mrs. Chu.

16
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,720
So this $100,000

17
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,200
is meant to buy my freedom,

18
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,400
my career,

19
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,820
and my dignity?

20
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:19,370
Interpret it however you like.

21
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,400
But if you insist on
marrying into this family

22
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,600
with that stubborn innocence of yours,

23
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:26,490
life between us is going to
be very difficult.

24
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:27,920
Whose idea is this?

25
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,000
All of us agreed on it.

26
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,600
Hong,

27
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,040
you mean you agreed to let me
be with Nanfeng?

28
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,520
You've fooled around enough
all these years.

29
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,920
I know what you're like,

30
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,040
and I can see

31
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,840
you're serious about this girl.

32
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,610
Since I can't stop you,

33
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,640
I might as well give you my blessing.

34
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,000
But

35
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:56,650
this prenup

36
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,200
is non-negotiable.

37
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,040
I've already got the bride price ready.

38
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,720
Sign it today,

39
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,400
and I will officially ask Miss Xie

40
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,320
for a talk tomorrow.

41
00:03:26,270 --> 00:03:28,400
Then I'll wait for your news tomorrow.

42
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,100
A family that thinks my future

43
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,600
is worth only $100,000

44
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,120
will never be good enough for me.

45
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,240
Now,

46
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,800
let's talk about

47
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,100
the price of leaving your son.

48
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,800
100,000 dollars.

49
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,000
You chose this yourself.

50
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,800
100,000 dollars.

51
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:07,800
Fine.

52
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,320
Shencheng's electronics
manufacturing industry

53
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:15,080
and its supporting supply chain
are just getting off the ground.

54
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,740
If you invest this money in it,

55
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,200
you could get at least
a tenfold return on your investment.

56
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,329
You've got it wrong.

57
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,530
That $100,000 is your
breakup compensation.

58
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:25,640
I'm not asking you for investment advice.

59
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,240
I know that

60
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,480
your willingness to pay me
means you think highly of me.

61
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:32,000
Consider this advice my gift in return.

62
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,280
Believe it or not, it's up to you.

63
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,560
I don't need your money.

64
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,800
I will leave on my own.

65
00:04:51,159 --> 00:04:51,680
Mom,

66
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,800
I truly want to be with her.

67
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,200
If anything—

68
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,880
or anyone—gets in our way,

69
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,200
I'm afraid

70
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:00,880
I might do something

71
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,160
even I can't control.

72
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,520
I know.

73
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,680
I'm trying to help you, aren't I?

74
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,040
[Admission Notice of Parson Design Academy
in America]

75
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:34,920
Chu Chunsheng,

76
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,120
maybe we should see each other again

77
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,780
when I can throw that $100,000

78
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,400
right back at you.

79
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,720
But before I leave,

80
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,380
I should go deal with my family first.

81
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,440
Come.

82
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,520
Drink some tea.

83
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,840
Long time no see.

84
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,200
Come.

85
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,200
Sit.

86
00:06:07,470 --> 00:06:08,680
Drink it while it's hot.

87
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,320
Come.

88
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,420
Fellow villagers,

89
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,280
elders,

90
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,600
I'm back.

91
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,800
I, Xie Nanfeng, am here today

92
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,530
to share the money with you!

93
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,290
Share money?

94
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,400
What money?

95
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,540
What money are you talking about?

96
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:28,680
Nanfeng,

97
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,120
where did you get all this money?

98
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,480
A developer took an interest in our land.

99
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:35,000
This is just the down payment
on the relocation compensation.

100
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,720
What?

101
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,800
They're demolishing our village?

102
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,920
Not the whole village.

103
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:40,480
The developer wants to pick
one plot of land to redevelop.

104
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,960
My dad wanted ours to be chosen,

105
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,440
so he told them everyone else's land
was no good

106
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:45,840
and ours was the only
blessed piece of land.

107
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,000
But,

108
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,000
he never told anyone

109
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,159
because he was afraid you'd be jealous

110
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:52,480
How could we keep something
this good all to ourselves?

111
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,010
We live in the same village.

112
00:06:55,490 --> 00:06:58,290
That ungrateful little bitch, Xie Nanfeng.

113
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,540
Ever since she latched onto Chu Chunsheng,

114
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:02,640
she's been acting like
she's above everyone.

115
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:04,100
We raised her for nothing.

116
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,360
I'm her biological father.

117
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,240
I gave her life and raised her.

118
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,640
She owes me for the rest of her life.

119
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:08,720
If she won't give us the money,

120
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,780
we'll go to Chu Chunsheng ourselves.

121
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,200
Fen!

122
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,400
Where are you rushing off to

123
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,640
like someone's handing out free money?

124
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,520
Yeah.

125
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,200
Your Nanfeng

126
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:20,400
said your family
got a big relocation payout

127
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,840
and was going to share it with everyone.

128
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,000
Relocation payout?

129
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,020
Where did it come from?

130
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,800
How come I don't know about this?

131
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,400
Stop keeping it to yourself.

132
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:31,260
The whole village knows
your family struck it rich.

133
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:31,960
I won't talk to you anymore.

134
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:32,690
I'm leaving.

135
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,480
This damn girl.

136
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,360
What the hell is she doing behind my back?

137
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,640
We live in the same village!

138
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,880
Move aside!

139
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,480
What nonsense are you talking about?

140
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:43,280
This is the money Chu Chunsheng gave me.

141
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,080
It's not a relocation payout.

142
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,840
Xie, you're pretty low!

143
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,600
You kept all the good things to yourself.

144
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,600
Dad!

145
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,440
Don't hide it.

146
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,200
You can't hide it anyway.

147
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,020
Don't believe him.

148
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:54,350
It's relocation money.

149
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,580
How about this:

150
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,520
I'll give everyone a little today,

151
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,300
so you can get a taste of it,

152
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:58,940
okay?

153
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:09,040
Don't grab!

154
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,360
Don't grab!

155
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,200
Don't grab!

156
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,560
It's all my family's money.

157
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,320
Don't grab!

158
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,240
I deliberately made the villagers think

159
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,830
you were pocketing the relocation money

160
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:27,890
just to make sure you'd finally
give up on staying here.

161
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,080
I can't start the life I truly want

162
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:35,600
until I get you out of Shencheng for good.

163
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,520
Don't grab.

164
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:40,890
I said, don't grab!

165
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,299
Fellow villagers,

166
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,559
elders.

167
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,400
Don't take it seriously.

168
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:45,880
As his daughter,

169
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:47,320
I apologize to everyone

170
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,240
on his behalf.

171
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,540
How about this:

172
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:53,920
I'll buy

173
00:08:53,950 --> 00:08:56,040
all your land myself.  I'll pay you exactly

174
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:56,960
what my family was offered.

175
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,160
Not a penny less.

176
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:58,760
Nanfeng,

177
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
are you serious?

178
00:09:00,230 --> 00:09:01,510
This is a big deal.

179
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,880
We all need to sign contracts.

180
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,200
Of course I'm serious.

181
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:04,800
Why would I bring the money

182
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,080
if I weren't?

183
00:09:07,020 --> 00:09:07,770
Village Chief,

184
00:09:07,770 --> 00:09:09,730
if everyone agrees right now,

185
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,800
I can pay you on the spot.

186
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,800
Not a penny less.

187
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,680
Agreed!

188
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,920
Agreed!

189
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:14,600
Agree to what?

190
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:18,880
Agreed!

191
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,880
In my previous life,

192
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:23,680
Chang Yongbin built an illegal factory
on this land.

193
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:26,210
When things went wrong,
he pinned it all on me.

194
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,770
Now I can use the money
I made from my stocks

195
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,770
to buy up all the land in Xie Village

196
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,840
and snuff out

197
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,600
your last hope of staying here.

198
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:35,940
[Oppose Illegal Demolition
and Demand Fair Compensation]

199
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,440
Where do you think the money is hidden?

200
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:40,400
We tore apart the house,
even searched under the bed,

201
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,520
and still couldn't find it.

202
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,360
Couldn't find it?

203
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,280
If they come back,

204
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,540
I'll beat him to death.

205
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,000
Drag him out

206
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,280
and give him a good beating.

207
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,040
Let's go check over there.

208
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,640
Okay, let's search this way.

209
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:52,860
Scared me to death.

210
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,720
What should we do?

211
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,520
Take this money.

212
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:07,160
It's enough to last you a lifetime.

213
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,090
Leave Shencheng

214
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:09,340
and never come back.

215
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,000
Just this much?

216
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,720
You're doing so well now.

217
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,240
Surely you can give us more.

218
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,700
Take the money and get out,

219
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,080
or the villagers will make you
pay for what you've done.

220
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:19,010
You won't even have a place to live.

221
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,880
Just pretend I never had you!

222
00:10:49,530 --> 00:10:51,390
She asked me for 100,000 dollars,

223
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,730
as a reward for leaving you.

224
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,400
That's impossible.

225
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,060
She's not that kind of person.

226
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,000
Since you know her so well,

227
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,080
then you should know that

228
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,560
once she's made up her mind,

229
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:08,010
no one can make her change it.

230
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,200
Chunsheng,

231
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,800
I heard Miss Xie
is leaving Shencheng tonight.
